  "prefLabel": "Fis 903.06 Piscassic River WMA",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 903.06 Piscassic River WMA. The Piscassic River WMA in Exeter and Newfields shall be subject to the following deed restrictions:\n\n(a) Horseback riding shall be prohibited; and\n\n(b) Bicycle riding shall be prohibited.\n\nSource. #8505, eff 12-7-05; ss by #10262, eff 1-29-13; ss by #12118, eff 2-24-17; ss by #14495, eff 1-27-26, EXPIRES: 1-27-36",
